---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import { site } from "@/config"
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Ikbal Turgut"
  description="An engineering practice focused on making complex software clearer."
>
  <header class="page-head section">
    <div class="shell">
      <span class="mono-label">The practice</span>
      <h1 class="page-title font-serif">
        A practice built around clarity under complexity.
      </h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell about-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I build web products and the systems underneath them, with a bias toward making
          complicated things legible — to the people who use them and the people who maintain
          them. Most of my work sits where interface design meets systems engineering: the
          seam where a good decision on one side quietly rescues the other.
        </p>
        <p>
          The through-line across everything here is a belief that clarity is engineering
          work, not a coat of paint. A system that can be read is a system that can be
          operated, changed, and trusted. That principle shapes how I model data, name things,
          budget latency, and decide what an interface should refuse to show.
        </p>
        <h2>How I work</h2>
        <p>
          I prefer boring infrastructure and interesting product. I write migrations I can walk
          back. I treat performance as a design constraint decided early, not a metric patched
          late. And I try to leave every system a little more legible than I found it.
        </p>
        <h2>This site</h2>
        <p>
          This is where I think in public — case notes from real work, essays on the craft, and
          shorter field notes as they occur to me. It's built to be static, fast, and quiet,
          the same way I like the systems I work on.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-side">
        <div class="side-block">
          <span class="index-num">Focus</span>
          <ul>
            <li>Interface systems</li>
            <li>Systems architecture</li>
            <li>Performance &amp; delivery</li>
            <li>Design systems</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="side-block">
          <span class="index-num">Elsewhere</span>
          <ul>
            <li><a class="side-link" href={site.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
            <li><a class="side-link" href={site.social.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
            <li><a class="side-link" href="/rss.xml">RSS</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="side-block">
          <span class="index-num">Contact</span>
          <ul>
            <li><a class="side-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="side-avail">{site.availability}</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    border-top: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 18ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 0.9fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about-side {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 90px;
  }
  .side-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: var(--rule-strong);
  }
  .side-block ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .side-link {
    color: var(--ink-70);
    background-image: linear-gradient(var(--ink), var(--ink));
    background-size: 0% 1px;
    background-position: 0 100%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, background-size 0.3s ease;
  }
  .side-link:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
    background-size: 100% 1px;
  }
  .side-avail {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about-side {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
